# /give 的回显用的是什么名字。
#
# gomc 之前打的是**注册名**（"Given stone * 1 to Steve"），真服打的是
# **显示名，而且外面套着方括号**（"Given [Stone] * 1 to Steve"）。
# 带命名空间的写法也换成显示名，染料/旗帜/床/头骷髅/毛这类还要跟**数据值**走。
#
# 2026-10-21 实测（协议机器人在线）：
#   give Steve stone              -> Given [Stone] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:dye 1 3  -> Given [Cocoa Beans] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:banner 1 14 -> Given [Orange Banner] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:bed 1 4  -> Given [Yellow Bed] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:skull 1 2 -> Given [Zombie Head] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve minecraft:wool 1 5 -> Given [Lime Wool] * 1 to Steve
#   give Steve Steve              -> 无输出（回显发给了玩家自己，控制台看不到）
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say X01
give Steve stone
say X02
give Steve minecraft:dye 1 3
say X03
give Steve minecraft:banner 1 14
say X04
give Steve minecraft:bed 1 4
say X05
give Steve minecraft:skull 1 2
say X06
give Steve minecraft:wool 1 5
say X07
give Steve Steve
say X08
